{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44492","headline":"诗三百三首 一八九 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一八九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携残荒草庐，其中烟火蔚。\n借问羣小儿，生来凡几日。\n门外有三车，迎之不肯出。\n饱食腹膨脝，个是痴顽物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}